## Shared contact plan: Node 1 <-> Node 2 only.
## Node 1 additionally loads cgr-hint.ionrc for path 1->2->3.
## Node 2 must NOT have 2->3 contacts so it abandons with SrNoKnownRoute.

m horizon +0

a range +0 +600 1 2 1
a range +0 +600 2 1 1

a contact +0 +600 1 2 100000
a contact +0 +600 2 1 100000
